  "description": "Thanks to the automatic shifting, the Rose Sneak 3 EQ MidStep gets you through the city even more easily and sportily. Without a motor, but with reliable automatic shifting, you ride directly and sportily, whilst the minimalist design and urban character are maintained. Characteristics and advantages The Rose Sneak 3 EQ MidStep combines a Shimano Cues Q‘Auto shifting system with 1x11 gears, Schwalbe Super Moto Performance tyres and integrated lighting. The high-quality components from renowned manufacturers combine equipment tailored to urban use with reliable function. At just 13.5 kg*, the urban bike is light, agile and fast for sporty riders who cover short distances and quick routes in the city. • Automatic gear shifting without a battery – 1x11 gears • Schwalbe Super Moto Performance tyres • DT Swiss wheels and carbon fork Ideal for • Sporty commutes on asphalt and paved paths • Quick errands in the city • Journeys to the office, to appointments or to sport • Movement in everyday life as an alternative to driving by car • City journeys in any weather Less suitable for • Large loads • Long cycle tours and bikepacking • Unpaved forestry tracks and jumps Equipment The Rose Sneak 3 EQ MidStep combines Shimano Cues Q‘Auto and extensive EQ equipment. The equipment includes Ergon saddle and grips, Hebie Alumee mudguards, integrated lighting, a rear stand, luggage rack, bell and hydraulic brakes from Shimano. The carbon fork and Rose pedals complement the lightweight concept of the urban bike and make it practically usable for the daily commute on roads and paved paths. • 1 Rose Sneak 3 EQ MidStep • 1 set of pedals (left and right) • 2 pad spacers for disc brakes • 2 reflectors red and white • 1 manual • 1 document bag Note: Weight: approx. 13.3* kg, may vary by up to +/- 5% due to manufacturing tolerances. Weight for frame colour Berry, size M, without pedals",
